pelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=e31e94c859284383a38b6a30c745d06f&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>UT_Test</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/1975/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-02-25 11:52:25] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-02-25T11:45:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-25T11:52:26+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163476318,"discussion_id":"684b3e2d0dc9d83c399358380d35ebcabba8f7b3","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复FlashAttentionScoreGrad算子在TND布局（变长序列）下，处理序列长度为零（`qLen == 0` 或 `kvLen == 0`）场景时，`isSeqExistZero`标志位更新逻辑的缺陷。原逻辑在遇到负的序列增量（表示EOD结束符）时，会错误地跳过对当前批次序列长度是否为零的判断，导致该标志位可能无法正确反映整个批次中是否存在零长度序列。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`GetShapeAttrsInfo`函数中处理TND布局下实际序列长度数组的逻辑。将`isSeqExistZero`标志位的更新从原先仅在`qLen >= 0 && kvLen >= 0`条件下执行，改为无条件执行。即无论是否遇到EOD结束符，只要当前计算出的`qLen`或`kvLen`为零，都会将标志位置为`true`。这确保了该标志位能准确记录整个批次中是否存在任何零长度序列，为后续的模板选择、分核优化等决策提供正确的依据。","created_at":"2026-02-25T11:46:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-25T11:46:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163660834,"discussion_id":"362f8d06d7c85d6cb30b99e7301ebd5bfcb42b59","body":"/chek-pr","created_at":"2026-02-26T19:32:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-26T19:32:46+08:00","user":{"id":"67cbf3554fa34746f03da5af","login":"coder_linx","object_id":"67cbf3554fa34746f03da5af","name":"林竹","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/da/ff/7d4af7fa4695f3496905dff9ea0c7d22464767ed0202115e8a6fd37f0f370642.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/coder_linx"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163660847,"discussion_id":"fd533e0297237bfe97729059643f13a4498edaca","body":"/check-pr","created_at":"2026-02-26T19:32:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-26T19:32:52+08:00","user":{"id":"67cbf3554fa34746f03da5af","login":"coder_linx","object_id":"67cbf3554fa34746f03da5af","name":"林竹","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/da/ff/7d4af7fa4695f3496905dff9ea0c7d22464767ed0202115e8a6fd37f0f370642.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/coder_linx"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163660852,"discussion_id":"c1619be48cfcd0e93394584adbf1ed93c039bce7","body":"**The following labels are not ready**.\n\nlgtm: Please wait for reviewers to review the code.\n\napproved: Please wait for committers to review the code.\n\n","created_at":"2026-02-26T19:32:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-26T19:32:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163665933,"discussion_id":"e3a246f3b09b96502c0a32340bad1f8ed7d4aadc","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-02-26T20:02:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-26T20:02:1